WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.035
Drag the original 3D objects to explore them from different angles.

2
00:00:04.035 --> 00:00:06.083
Four original polygon exhibits; keyboard rotation is supported.

3
00:00:06.083 --> 00:00:09.495
A* avoids walls; genetic search explores the visit order.

4
00:00:09.495 --> 00:00:15.743
Animate the itinerary through walkable grid cells.

5
00:00:15.743 --> 00:00:22.009
Close the western shortcut and compute a new walkable route.

6
00:00:22.009 --> 00:00:23.897
Models, map and itinerary are independent demonstration assets with runnable source.
